@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title AFTER MVP — Proposed / illustrative — Push, checks, review and guarded merge
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

actor Author
participant "Git Collaboration" as G
participant "Native Git backend" as N
participant "Workflow / check owner" as W
actor "Eligible reviewer\nper actual source policy" as R
Author -> G : actual client push, current repository/ref credential
G -> N : admitted native transfer / validated ref intent
N --> G : actual per-ref outcome
Author -> G : open PR for exact source / target context
G -> W : attributable revision event, if eligible
W --> G : actual check evidence or unavailable / unknown
R -> G : review exact evaluated revision/context
Author -> G : request merge of expected refs
G -> G : current authority, review/check context and conflict evaluation
alt all actual required gates satisfied
 G -> N : guarded expected-old target update + actual coordination
 N --> G : native success / conflict / unknown
 G -> G : reconcile metadata with attributable native evidence
else missing / stale / failed / unknown required gate
 G --> Author : safe refusal / explicit re-evaluation
end
note over G,W
 Revision event does not authorize executing untrusted code.
 Workflow isolation/enabling and deployment approval remain separate.
end note

@enduml
